  "query_preview": "..\n(Monday through next Saturday)\nIssued at 1025 PM CDT Fri May 8 2026\n\nThe cold front will exit the area Monday morning, allowing for drier \nand cooler air to move in behind it. Highs on Monday will be in the \nmid-60s along the Plateau and into the low-70s elsewhere. Another \nsystem does move through the Ohio Valley late Tuesday into \nWednesday, but it doesn't look to mean much for us with just another \nlow rain chance with light rain amounts. It does help to keep \ntemperatures a little below normal for mid-May, but temperatures \nwill make their way back into the low and mid-80s by the end of the \nweek.",
